            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.12

- The full-screen background now shows brighter, more saturated album colors, closer to Apple Music. Extracted colors are normalized to a vivid mid-tone, the color wash is more opaque and fuller, and the darkening overlay is much lighter — so the backdrop no longer looks dull.
]]></description>
